# PROGRESS.md, Project Documentation.md and urls.md were git-ignored while this was a
# private working directory. They are tracked from M5 onward: they are the record of what
# was built and why, and for a submission that reasoning is worth more than the code alone.
#
# They contain no credentials -- scanned before un-ignoring. They do carry the AWS account
# id, which is not a secret (it appears in every ARN) and was already committed in
# CLAUDE.md, and the live Function URLs, which are public endpoints protected by API keys.
